# EAS uploads the whole repo. Trim files the Android build never needs.
# Keep every package.json so the pnpm workspace still resolves.
# Session state dirs at the repo root hold Unix sockets (nvim, pi agent) that
# break the upload copy ("Cannot copy a socket file"); never needed by the build.
/.local
/apps/agent-mobile/android
/apps/agent-mobile/ios
/docs
/.github
/PLAN.md
/PRODUCT.md
/apps/api/src
/apps/web/src
/packages/e2e-tests
/packages/integration-tests
